WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

4
01:35.600 --> 01:36.280
Dali,

5
01:46.320 --> 01:47.440
why did you do this

6
01:47.440 --> 01:48.800
without telling me in advance?

7
01:48.800 --> 01:50.800
Didn't you say she was a nice person?

8
01:50.800 --> 01:51.840
She is nice.

9
01:51.840 --> 01:52.960
Nice my ass.

10
01:56.600 --> 01:58.240
Dali, tell me the truth.

11
01:58.479 --> 01:59.940
What happened to Wangang?

12
02:00.280 --> 02:01.960
Got blackmailed by a bunch of unruly people.

13
02:01.960 --> 02:03.520
Greedy bastards.

14
02:05.560 --> 02:07.520
Yeah, that's really annoying.

15
02:08.000 --> 02:09.460
How about this? Calm down.

16
02:09.600 --> 02:11.480
I'll find a chance to talk to her another day,

17
02:11.480 --> 02:12.000
okay?

18
02:12.080 --> 02:13.640
If she wants to sue, let her sue.

19
02:13.640 --> 02:16.040
Go ahead and sue. I'll play along to the end.

20
02:29.280 --> 02:30.760
Mr. Wan, you called me here in such a hurry.

21
02:30.760 --> 02:31.820
What's the matter?

22
02:35.560 --> 02:38.600
This is the contract Attorney Li drafted last year, right?

23
02:38.600 --> 02:39.400
That's right.

24
02:39.760 --> 02:42.880
Since the contract is nominally for buying their shrimp,

25
02:42.880 --> 02:44.480
can we now

26
02:44.480 --> 02:46.480
have the company in the contract

27
02:46.640 --> 02:49.560
sue them for failing to deliver on time?

28
02:50.280 --> 02:51.560
Let them choose.

29
02:51.800 --> 02:53.920
Either pay up or drop the lawsuit.

30
02:54.000 --> 02:56.800
Yes, it's clearly written in the terms.

31
02:57.079 --> 02:58.760
Delivery time, tonnage,

32
02:58.760 --> 03:01.620
and liability for breach of contract are all there.

33
03:01.800 --> 03:05.280
Mr. Wan, you're quite good at thinking outside the box.

34
03:05.600 --> 03:08.330
But does President Wan know about this decision?

35
03:08.360 --> 03:11.120
There's no need to go through President Wan for such a small matter.

36
03:11.120 --> 03:13.480
My decision is his decision.

37
03:14.880 --> 03:15.320
Okay.

38
03:16.160 --> 03:17.620
Then I have no objections.

39
03:17.640 --> 03:19.960
Wangang wants you to fulfill last year's contract.

40
03:19.960 --> 03:20.520
Yes,

41
03:20.600 --> 03:22.960
it's last year's shrimp purchase contract.

42
03:22.960 --> 03:24.800
They said if we don't provide the shrimp as agreed,

43
03:24.800 --> 03:25.880
it's a breach of contract,

44
03:25.880 --> 03:27.640
and they want us to compensate for the losses.

45
03:27.640 --> 03:30.520
It was written that way to make us pay in disguise.

46
03:30.520 --> 03:32.280
I don't have any shrimp to give them.

47
03:32.280 --> 03:33.840
Isn't this just playing dirty?

48
03:33.840 --> 03:34.960
Okay, I got it.

49
03:35.160 --> 03:36.120
Don't worry.

50
03:36.120 --> 03:37.280
I'll call and ask.

51
03:38.520 --> 03:39.520
Hello, Xiaolong.

52
03:39.600 --> 03:41.280
What's going on with the shrimp purchase contract?

53
03:41.280 --> 03:43.280
Wasn't last year's matter already settled?

54
03:43.280 --> 03:44.400
It was settled,

55
03:44.600 --> 03:46.400
but someone wants to dig up the past.

56
03:46.400 --> 03:47.800
Who wants to dig up the past?

57
03:47.800 --> 03:48.720
Do you?

58
03:49.280 --> 03:50.600
Thanks a lot.

59
03:50.960 --> 03:52.760
Is such a terrible idea my style?

60
03:52.880 --> 03:53.810
Don't insult me.

61
03:53.920 --> 03:55.000
True.

62
03:55.800 --> 03:57.640
Could this be Wan Zhuoli's idea?

63
03:58.160 --> 03:58.960
You know him?

64
03:59.480 --> 04:00.680
I don't just know him.

65
04:00.880 --> 04:01.960
I've even met him.

66
04:01.960 --> 04:04.290
He put on a big show of offering me amnesty.

67
04:04.560 --> 04:06.280
Fine. If he wants to play it this way,

68
04:06.280 --> 04:07.840
I'll have to spar with him.

69
04:08.040 --> 04:09.400
Doesn't he want to dig up graves?

70
04:09.400 --> 04:11.040
Then I'll show him a corpse coming back to life.

71
04:11.040 --> 04:12.770
Alright, do whatever you want.

72
04:16.360 --> 04:18.800
Come back to life.

73
04:23.200 --> 04:24.640
Hello, Brother Jun.

74
04:25.280 --> 04:27.680
You haven't lost your old skills, have you?

75
04:28.240 --> 04:29.160
I want to invite

76
04:29.240 --> 04:32.900
the uncles of the Eight Great Guardians to come out of retirement.

77
04:33.680 --> 04:35.120
On behalf of our child,

78
04:35.120 --> 04:36.560
I want to thank her four uncles.

79
04:36.560 --> 04:37.720
Our daughter is doing

80
04:37.720 --> 04:39.640
something very righteous right now.

81
04:39.640 --> 04:41.800
And we old folks will uphold justice.

82
04:41.880 --> 04:42.680
Do you remember our old slogan

83
04:42.680 --> 04:44.240
for the Eight Guardians?

84
04:44.240 --> 04:45.200
Of course. How could we forget?

85
04:45.200 --> 04:46.200
Eight Guardians,

86
04:46.240 --> 04:47.240
shaking the world!

87
04:47.240 --> 04:47.840
Let's go.

88
04:48.280 --> 04:48.920
Move out.

89
05:02.200 --> 05:03.880
Why is there no signal here?

90
05:04.240 --> 05:06.880
We agreed on a time. Why aren't they here yet?

91
05:07.240 --> 05:09.300
Are all lawyers this untrustworthy?

92
05:09.480 --> 05:10.810
I'll call and ask again.

93
05:40.200 --> 05:41.000
Come unload the goods.

94
05:41.000 --> 05:41.640
Alright.

95
05:57.880 --> 05:58.960
Wait, Xiao Longnv.

96
05:59.280 --> 06:00.210
What do you mean?

97
06:00.440 --> 06:02.700
Delivery. Just following the contract.

98
06:02.880 --> 06:04.160
We want live shrimp.

99
06:04.160 --> 06:05.880
Why did you bring these dead ones?

100
06:05.880 --> 06:08.440
The contract didn't specify whether they should be dead or alive.

101
06:08.440 --> 06:11.080
You accepted the dead shrimp last year, didn't you?

102
06:11.080 --> 06:11.960
Don't worry.

103
06:11.960 --> 06:14.600
They died exactly the same way as last year.

104
06:14.720 --> 06:15.960
We don't cheat anyone.

105
06:15.960 --> 06:17.560
Anyway, on the market,

106
06:17.560 --> 06:20.400
finding this many dead shrimp with excessive mercury

107
06:20.400 --> 06:21.320
isn't easy,

108
06:21.320 --> 06:23.520
but the quantity is definitely enough.

109
06:26.240 --> 06:28.520
Why are you looking at me? Speak.

110
06:28.520 --> 06:29.600
Will this work?

111
06:30.280 --> 06:31.120
The goods are delivered.

112
06:31.120 --> 06:32.720
If there's nothing else, we'll leave first.

113
06:32.720 --> 06:33.800
Let's go.

114
06:33.960 --> 06:34.400
Let's go.

115
06:34.400 --> 06:36.000
Come, Menmen, come.

116
06:36.080 --> 06:37.280
Close it and let's go.

117
06:41.520 --> 06:42.080
Okay, leave it.

118
06:42.080 --> 06:42.840
Well, you know...

119
06:42.840 --> 06:44.700
Mr. Wan, actually this matter...

120
06:46.240 --> 06:47.800
Just close it. Close it.

121
07:01.960 --> 07:03.960
Thank you so much.

122
07:03.960 --> 07:05.360
It's the least I could do.

123
07:05.480 --> 07:06.880
Mainly, I have to thank you.

124
07:06.880 --> 07:08.440
You didn't scoop out those shrimp.

125
07:08.440 --> 07:10.520
Otherwise, where would I get so many tons of shrimp?

126
07:10.520 --> 07:13.040
Your method was the key.

127
07:13.880 --> 07:15.200
And Mr. Xiao

128
07:15.480 --> 07:17.360
and his tough friends

129
07:17.680 --> 07:19.760
helped me a lot.

130
07:20.760 --> 07:23.320
Like father, like daughter.

131
07:23.320 --> 07:25.840
Now do you believe in Sister Long's ability, Uncle Pan?

132
07:25.840 --> 07:28.320
I've always believed in her.

133
07:31.480 --> 07:33.280
Since Wangang has this attitude,

134
07:33.280 --> 07:35.680
don't settle with them secretly this time.

135
07:36.760 --> 07:40.080
I heard Mr. Wan Jr. was scolded by Mr. Wan Sr.,

136
07:41.600 --> 07:43.800
and had three months' salary deducted.

137
07:43.800 --> 07:45.640
Then Mr. Wan's way of educating

138
07:45.720 --> 07:47.360
is indeed a bit limited.

139
07:47.840 --> 07:48.680
After making such a scene,

140
07:48.680 --> 07:50.240
withdrawing the lawsuit is definitely out of the question.

141
07:50.240 --> 07:54.040
You deliberately didn't stop the shrimp purchase contract, right?

142
07:54.120 --> 07:55.600
To teach a brat a lesson,

143
07:55.760 --> 07:57.760
don't you have to let him take a fall?

144
07:57.960 --> 07:59.120
Don't overdo it.

145
08:00.760 --> 08:01.960
Don't worry, Mentor.

146
08:03.600 --> 08:07.000
You've talked to Xiaolong about the case, right?

147
08:07.920 --> 08:09.320
It won't affect you guys, will it?

148
08:09.320 --> 08:10.920
We've both agreed

149
08:12.280 --> 08:13.760
to rely on our own abilities.

150
08:13.760 --> 08:14.560
That's good.

151
08:26.480 --> 08:27.480
No shaking hands.

152
08:35.640 --> 08:36.400
Your Honor.

153
08:36.520 --> 08:38.880
This is a test report issued by

154
08:38.880 --> 08:41.200
a third-party testing agency randomly selected by the court

155
08:41.200 --> 08:43.840
through a lottery: Qingwan Fishery Assessment.

156
08:43.840 --> 08:45.040
The results show that

157
08:45.040 --> 08:48.400
in Wangang's discharge system facing the breeding farm,

158
08:48.400 --> 08:50.060
no pollutants were detected.

159
08:50.440 --> 08:51.560
This report shows that

160
08:51.560 --> 08:52.520
over the past ten years,

161
08:52.520 --> 08:54.560
Wangang's investment in environmental protection equipment

162
08:54.560 --> 08:56.880
has totaled 320 million yuan.

163
08:57.080 --> 08:59.680
And the expenditure on treating hazardous chemical waste

164
08:59.680 --> 09:02.080
accounts for 7.3% of the total operating costs,

165
09:02.080 --> 09:04.040
which is much higher than the chemical industry's

166
09:04.040 --> 09:05.640
average of 3.8%.

167
09:05.640 --> 09:07.440
Therefore, this report is sufficient to prove

168
09:07.440 --> 09:11.440
the importance Wangang attaches to environmental protection investment.

169
09:11.440 --> 09:13.680
We have always used the high-temperature roasting method

170
09:13.680 --> 09:15.540
to treat mercury catalyst waste.

171
09:15.760 --> 09:17.920
We never skimp on waste treatment.

172
09:17.920 --> 09:20.640
We use the best and most expensive epoxy resin.

173
09:20.640 --> 09:22.320
This is also what Mr. Wan has repeatedly ordered.

174
09:22.320 --> 09:24.440
I also have a test report here.

175
09:24.440 --> 09:25.520
The report shows

176
09:26.040 --> 09:28.120
that the dead shrimp in the farm

177
09:28.120 --> 09:31.080
have a mercury content of 1.2 milligrams per kilogram,

178
09:31.080 --> 09:33.400
which is 2.4 times the national standard.

179
09:33.400 --> 09:35.680
And in Wangang's production waste,

180
09:35.680 --> 09:39.480
which happens to contain a large amount of the toxic heavy metal mercury.

181
09:39.480 --> 09:42.720
In addition, according to Leyang Sealing Technology Co., Ltd.'s

182
09:42.720 --> 09:44.640
pipeline maintenance engineer

183
09:44.640 --> 09:46.560
Zhang Jianxin's testimony,

184
09:46.720 --> 09:47.800
last June,

185
09:47.880 --> 09:50.440
Wangang replaced a section of pipeline in the workshop.

186
09:50.440 --> 09:54.000
The reason was that the aging weld of Wangang's original waste pipeline

187
09:54.000 --> 09:56.730
caused the leakage of mercury catalyst residue.

188
09:56.800 --> 09:58.120
Combined with the farm's

189
09:58.120 --> 10:00.000
mercury pollution timeline this year,

190
10:00.000 --> 10:03.400
we believe that the mercury pollutants leaked last year

191
10:03.400 --> 10:04.840
were not completely cleared,

192
10:04.840 --> 10:07.560
and the residue caused this damage.

193
10:07.640 --> 10:09.280
The death of the shrimp at the farm

194
10:09.280 --> 10:11.480
is directly related to Wangang.

195
10:11.560 --> 10:12.240
Your Honor,

196
10:12.240 --> 10:13.120
I have an opinion

197
10:13.120 --> 10:15.120
from an expert assistant to submit.

198
10:16.080 --> 10:18.760
The sea area where the farm is located experiences semidiurnal tides.

199
10:18.760 --> 10:21.000
Assuming a mercury catalyst leak occurred last year,

200
10:21.000 --> 10:22.960
the pollutants would have been driven by the tides

201
10:22.960 --> 10:24.400
and spread southeast.

202
10:24.400 --> 10:25.600
And within three months,

203
10:25.600 --> 10:26.400
they would have been diluted to

204
10:26.400 --> 10:29.240
less than 0.001 milligrams per kilogram.

205
10:29.240 --> 10:30.100
In other words,

206
10:30.200 --> 10:31.640
even if Wangang had

207
10:31.640 --> 10:33.160
a leak a year ago,

208
10:33.160 --> 10:36.080
the pollutants would have been carried away by the ocean currents long ago.

209
10:36.080 --> 10:38.120
They couldn't possibly affect the present.

210
10:38.120 --> 10:40.160
The above evidence is sufficient to prove

211
10:40.160 --> 10:42.840
that Wangang has no pollution problems.

212
10:51.160 --> 10:52.240
All rise.

213
10:56.360 --> 10:58.480
In the case of the plaintiff Pan Hongsheng

214
10:58.480 --> 11:01.240
versus the defendant Wansheng Tiangang Chemical Group Co., Ltd.

215
11:01.240 --> 11:03.240
regarding environmental pollution liability,

216
11:03.240 --> 11:05.400
the evidence submitted by the plaintiff is insufficient to prove

217
11:05.400 --> 11:08.240
that the defendant discharged pollutants in 2025.

218
11:08.240 --> 11:10.600
The defendant's leak incident in 2024

219
11:10.600 --> 11:12.000
and the plaintiff's claim

220
11:12.000 --> 11:14.240
of aquatic product death

221
11:14.240 --> 11:16.720
have no legal causal relationship.

222
11:16.760 --> 11:18.840
In summary, the plaintiff's claim

223
11:18.880 --> 11:21.560
lacks factual and legal basis,

224
11:21.560 --> 11:23.400
and this court does not support it.

225
11:23.400 --> 11:24.760
What is this?

226
11:24.760 --> 11:25.600
What's going on, Pan?

227
11:25.600 --> 11:27.200
How could they rule like this?

228
11:27.200 --> 11:28.200
Our shrimp died for nothing.

229
11:28.200 --> 11:29.460
What about our losses?

230
11:29.560 --> 11:31.160
Who will be responsible for the losses?

231
11:31.160 --> 11:31.920
Exactly.

232
11:38.600 --> 11:39.280
Pan.

233
11:39.440 --> 11:42.120
You said this female lawyer was so capable.

234
11:42.360 --> 11:43.520
Why did she lose?

235
11:43.520 --> 11:44.240
Exactly.

236
11:44.240 --> 11:46.500
If you ask me, she's just not good enough.

237
11:46.720 --> 11:48.250
What are you talking about?

238
11:50.040 --> 11:50.600
Let's go.

239
11:52.800 --> 11:54.840
Attorney Xiao, don't be angry.

240
11:54.840 --> 11:57.160
They're just too anxious.

241
11:57.200 --> 12:00.200
Uncle Pan, search your conscience.

242
12:00.400 --> 12:01.760
In all of Leyang, besides Sister Long,

243
12:01.760 --> 12:03.420
who else would take your case?

244
12:03.440 --> 12:05.440
You know how difficult it is, right?

245
12:05.440 --> 12:07.300
You... That's enough, Miaomiao.

246
12:08.120 --> 12:10.480
We weren't fully prepared either.

247
12:10.480 --> 12:12.520
Attorney Xiao, don't say that.

248
12:13.120 --> 12:15.240
I know our case is hard to win.

249
12:15.920 --> 12:17.380
No matter what others say,

250
12:20.480 --> 12:21.520
I believe in you.

251
12:22.600 --> 12:25.330
If we lose the first trial, we'll keep appealing.

252
12:25.600 --> 12:27.200
I won't give up this time.

253
12:27.840 --> 12:29.760
Okay, I'll keep investigating.

254
12:31.880 --> 12:32.740
Attorney Xiao.

255
12:33.080 --> 12:35.040
Don't bother. You can't win.

256
12:35.960 --> 12:38.420
By the way, that capital injection proposal

257
12:38.720 --> 12:40.680
is still valid for 15 days.

258
12:43.840 --> 12:44.360
Dali.

259
12:45.000 --> 12:46.660
You go first. I'll talk to her.

260
12:46.800 --> 12:48.130
Okay, comfort her well.

261
12:51.280 --> 12:53.210
Attorney Xiao, I'm leaving first.

262
13:01.520 --> 13:02.160
Well...

263
13:03.880 --> 13:04.920
Let me take you back.

264
13:04.920 --> 13:05.720
I drove.

265
13:06.040 --> 13:06.680
No need.

266
13:06.680 --> 13:08.720
My car has air conditioning.

267
13:09.720 --> 13:11.450
I don't like air conditioning.

268
13:12.200 --> 13:14.060
Then I'll drink with you tonight.

269
13:16.120 --> 13:18.080
You're wearing three-piece suits now,

270
13:18.080 --> 13:19.320
one after another.

271
13:19.320 --> 13:22.380
Aren't you worried about sweat stains in your armpits?

272
13:24.760 --> 13:27.040
Looks good. I'm leaving, Mr. Dong.

273
13:35.600 --> 13:36.240
Let's go.

274
13:51.640 --> 13:53.440
Xiaolong lost to Xiaoxin again.

275
13:54.200 --> 13:56.480
They are lawyers.

276
13:56.480 --> 13:57.520
Isn't it normal to win or lose?

277
13:57.520 --> 13:58.720
I think they are fine.

278
13:59.240 --> 14:01.960
Xiaoxin even asked Xiaolong out for dinner a few days ago.

279
14:01.960 --> 14:03.320
Then he really figured it out.

280
14:03.320 --> 14:05.080
I think Xiaolong figured it out too.

281
14:05.080 --> 14:07.010
I really hope they can be together.

282
14:07.320 --> 14:08.520
So we can be in-laws.

283
14:09.040 --> 14:12.240
In the future, they'll get married and have kids.

284
14:12.640 --> 14:14.200
I'll just babysit for them.

285
14:14.200 --> 14:15.360
Come on.

286
14:15.440 --> 14:17.440
You'll just raise a little Xiao Jun.

287
14:17.880 --> 14:19.880
And bring up a gang of eight little warriors.

288
14:19.880 --> 14:20.720
I... I can't babysit? What did you say?

289
14:20.720 --> 14:21.980
Who are you insulting?

290
14:22.080 --> 14:23.560
Go serve the rice.

291
14:23.560 --> 14:24.680
It's too early.

292
14:24.680 --> 14:26.640
If you serve the rice now, won't it get cold?

293
14:26.640 --> 14:28.280
Just serve it and let it cool.

294
14:33.840 --> 14:36.600
Li Guochen, you didn't cook the rice.

295
14:37.000 --> 14:39.600
Are you waiting for the raw rice to cook itself?

296
14:39.640 --> 14:40.440
Didn't I press the button?

297
14:40.440 --> 14:41.640
You didn't.

298
14:41.640 --> 14:42.970
I remember pressing it.

299
14:43.240 --> 14:44.840
Let me do it.

300
14:45.800 --> 14:47.640
Your memory is really failing you now.

301
14:47.640 --> 14:48.120
You really need to get it checked.

302
14:48.120 --> 14:51.320
Find a traditional Chinese doctor and get some medicine.

303
14:52.120 --> 14:53.850
I grabbed too many chopsticks.

304
14:56.520 --> 14:57.480
Let's eat the food first.

305
14:57.480 --> 14:59.520
I pressed the button for the rice too late.

306
14:59.520 --> 15:00.640
It'll be ready in a minute.

307
15:00.640 --> 15:02.200
Why don't you have a drink?

308
15:02.200 --> 15:03.040
I... I don't drink.

309
15:03.040 --> 15:04.960
Dad, he hasn't drunk since he was a kid. Did you forget?

310
15:04.960 --> 15:06.240
Will you have some then?

311
15:06.240 --> 15:07.480
I have to read the case files later.

312
15:07.480 --> 15:08.520
I'll drink with you... Let Dad Li drink with you.

313
15:08.520 --> 15:10.080
No, work is work.

314
15:10.080 --> 15:11.240
Life is life.

315
15:11.240 --> 15:12.640
You must separate them.

316
15:12.800 --> 15:13.530
Understood.

317
15:13.640 --> 15:15.760
Brother Jun is hinting at me. How could I not understand?

318
15:15.760 --> 15:16.890
I can separate them.

319
15:16.960 --> 15:18.040
So what if we lost the first trial?

320
15:18.040 --> 15:19.320
There's still the second trial.

321
15:19.320 --> 15:20.680
We're fine.

322
15:21.360 --> 15:22.040
We're fine.

323
15:22.080 --> 15:23.840
Here, your favorite beans and shrimp.

324
15:23.840 --> 15:24.600
What a coincidence.

325
15:24.600 --> 15:26.330
Look, we picked the same piece.

326
15:26.480 --> 15:27.680
Let me peel it for you.

327
15:31.520 --> 15:32.600
Are you still going to appeal?

328
15:32.600 --> 15:33.840
Of course I am.

329
15:34.280 --> 15:36.240
The shrimp has such a high concentration of mercury.

330
15:36.240 --> 15:37.120
Where did it come from?

331
15:37.120 --> 15:38.800
It must be polluted.

332
15:38.880 --> 15:40.760
Looking at the whole city,

333
15:40.760 --> 15:43.160
only Wangang has such a large production capacity

334
15:43.160 --> 15:45.600
to discharge so much mercury waste.

335
15:46.160 --> 15:47.600
But legally speaking,

336
15:48.520 --> 15:51.240
between possible pollution and actual pollution,

337
15:51.240 --> 15:53.440
there are several missing links in the chain of evidence.

338
15:53.440 --> 15:56.400
Speaking of pollution, it's really something.

339
15:56.520 --> 15:57.980
One year when I was on duty,

340
15:58.280 --> 16:00.360
I went to a small electroplating factory.

341
16:00.360 --> 16:01.680
The wastewater they discharged

342
16:01.680 --> 16:03.920
polluted the entire river.

343
16:03.960 --> 16:04.840
The water stank,

344
16:04.840 --> 16:07.320
and the surface was pitch black.

345
16:07.720 --> 16:08.680
The common people wouldn't stand for it.

346
16:08.680 --> 16:09.560
Didn't they say back then

347
16:09.560 --> 16:11.280
that they just discharged it into the river,

348
16:11.280 --> 16:12.600
the whole river and the sea?

349
16:12.600 --> 16:13.960
They just discharged it like that.

350
16:13.960 --> 16:15.120
At that time, pharmaceutical factories,

351
16:15.120 --> 16:16.680
construction waste,

352
16:16.680 --> 16:19.520
and crude oil spills, there were so many incidents.

353
16:19.520 --> 16:21.400
This happened in the Songhua River.

354
16:21.400 --> 16:22.760
Tens of thousands of people went there to block it.

355
16:22.760 --> 16:24.840
The city's water supply system

356
16:24.840 --> 16:26.440
has been completely cut off.

357
16:26.920 --> 16:28.120
Think about it.

358
16:29.040 --> 16:30.800
These old enterprises

359
16:31.240 --> 16:34.080
must have some historical disputes.

360
16:34.320 --> 16:35.880
Especially the chemical industry,

361
16:35.880 --> 16:38.120
which deals with the environment all year round.

362
16:38.120 --> 16:40.720
How could there be no problems with sewage

363
16:40.720 --> 16:42.240
or waste disposal?

364
16:42.560 --> 16:46.160
As a well-known,

365
16:46.160 --> 16:49.400
30-year-old chemical enterprise in the city,

366
16:50.000 --> 16:53.000
Wangang has never had a single litigation dispute.

367
16:53.440 --> 16:54.840
The director makes a good point.

368
16:54.840 --> 16:55.840
Why don't we check

369
16:55.840 --> 16:57.480
Wangang's previous litigation records?

370
16:57.480 --> 16:59.720
Yes, we can also check the news reports.

371
16:59.960 --> 17:03.480
Maybe the breakthrough for the appeal is right here.

372
17:03.800 --> 17:05.400
We still shouldn't underestimate them.

373
17:05.400 --> 17:06.839
Although there is no evidence right now,

374
17:06.839 --> 17:08.760
based on what I know about Xiao Longnv...

375
17:08.760 --> 17:10.720
She's very likely to trace it back,

376
17:10.760 --> 17:12.440
so we should also carefully check

377
17:12.440 --> 17:15.440
all the litigation records of Wangang since its establishment

378
17:15.440 --> 17:18.440
to see if there are any disputes related to pollution.

379
17:51.560 --> 17:52.020
Come in.

380
17:52.840 --> 17:54.600
Lawyer Li, we found something.

381
18:05.920 --> 18:07.120
Miaomiao, look here.

382
18:07.320 --> 18:08.360
Look here.

383
18:09.600 --> 18:10.480
Recently,

384
18:10.480 --> 18:13.600
Xue, an employee of Wangang Chemical Plant,

385
18:13.600 --> 18:15.640
filed a lawsuit against the plant.

386
18:15.640 --> 18:18.520
It was because she suffered multiple miscarriages

387
18:18.960 --> 18:22.960
and suspects it's related to environmental pollution in the workshop.

388
18:23.720 --> 18:24.440
Right.

389
18:25.960 --> 18:27.490
Here, let me take a picture.

390
18:28.600 --> 18:29.200
Director,

391
18:29.760 --> 18:32.420
the person who sued Wangang back then is Xue Lin.

392
18:32.480 --> 18:33.400
We checked.

393
18:33.440 --> 18:35.280
She now lives in Fuyuan Village.

394
18:35.840 --> 18:39.440
As for exactly where, we'll ask around when we get to the village.

395
18:55.840 --> 18:58.280
Excuse me, sir, do you know Xue Lin?

396
18:58.760 --> 19:01.160
Just keep walking straight down this road.

397
19:01.360 --> 19:03.800
After passing three intersections, you'll see a well.

398
19:03.800 --> 19:05.600
Her house is right next to the well.

399
19:05.600 --> 19:06.530
As for her now...

400
19:07.720 --> 19:08.580
She's gone mad.

401
19:08.800 --> 19:10.280
She acts crazy all day.

402
19:22.200 --> 19:24.200
What is all this stuff on the window?

403
19:26.080 --> 19:26.840
Xue Lin.

404
19:40.880 --> 19:43.600
The moon is bright.

405
19:47.160 --> 19:47.880
Xue Lin.

406
19:50.080 --> 19:51.400
Are you Xue Lin?

407
19:57.880 --> 19:58.680
Xue Lin?

408
20:00.600 --> 20:01.680
I am a lawyer.

409
20:01.960 --> 20:03.160
My name is Xiao Longnv.

410
20:03.160 --> 20:04.600
I want to ask you something.

411
20:04.600 --> 20:05.640
Twenty-eight years ago,

412
20:05.640 --> 20:07.560
did you work at Wangang?

413
20:08.080 --> 20:09.600
At that time, you suspected

414
20:09.600 --> 20:12.600
that mercury poisoning caused your multiple miscarriages,

415
20:12.600 --> 20:14.640
so you sued them, right?

416
20:17.880 --> 20:18.920
Lawsuit.

417
20:22.560 --> 20:24.840
Lawyer Wang, sue Wangang.

418
20:25.600 --> 20:26.920
We must win the case.

419
20:27.040 --> 20:28.400
We must bring them down.

420
20:28.400 --> 20:31.360
Okay, well, my surname is Xiao.

421
20:31.400 --> 20:32.400
I have evidence.

422
20:33.080 --> 20:34.640
I have a lot of evidence.

423
20:35.000 --> 20:36.600
I kept it all for Lawyer Wang.

424
20:36.640 --> 20:38.560
I'll find it for you.

425
20:43.360 --> 20:43.920
Look.

426
20:45.760 --> 20:47.720
Look, this is all of it.

427
20:48.720 --> 20:50.640
It was really hard to collect this evidence.

428
20:50.640 --> 20:54.840
Look, this is the confession of the boss of Wangang.

429
20:55.160 --> 20:58.240
He confessed to all the sins he committed in his life.

430
20:59.160 --> 21:02.320
This is the confidential map of Wangang.

431
21:03.000 --> 21:05.640
See the dense red dots?

432
21:06.080 --> 21:08.000
Those are all the drugs they hid.

433
21:10.400 --> 21:12.880
This is my blood test report.

434
21:13.840 --> 21:15.600
This one is quite impressive.

435
21:15.600 --> 21:17.000
It's an execution permit

436
21:17.160 --> 21:20.000
issued by the UN for the boss of Wangang.

437
21:20.280 --> 21:22.840
That means we know where he is.

438
21:23.240 --> 21:25.280
If caught, they'll be shot.

439
21:26.640 --> 21:29.040
Sue them. Sue Wangang. Win against them.

440
21:31.160 --> 21:32.160
My baby is crying.

441
21:32.280 --> 21:34.280
Wait a minute. The baby is crying.

442
21:46.920 --> 21:47.720
Xue Lin,

443
21:48.280 --> 21:51.210
is the Lawyer Wang you mentioned named Wang Binghui?

444
21:51.560 --> 21:52.480
Yes, yes, yes.

445
21:52.720 --> 21:55.240
Lawyer Wang is a great guy.

446
21:55.960 --> 21:56.800
A great guy.

447
22:05.440 --> 22:06.370
Li... Lawyer Li.

448
22:09.760 --> 22:10.690
Why are you here?

449
22:16.560 --> 22:17.800
It turns out that back then,

450
22:17.800 --> 22:20.530
Master not only represented Xue Lin in this case,

451
22:20.880 --> 22:23.740
but has also been sending her money all these years.

452
22:23.880 --> 22:25.940
Why have I never heard him mention it?

453
22:29.920 --> 22:32.850
Xiaolong, how long has it been since you drank my tea?

454
22:33.160 --> 22:35.560
Taste it. Is it still the same flavor?

455
22:35.560 --> 22:36.620
Thank you, Master.

456
22:36.960 --> 22:38.020
Thank you, Master.

457
22:38.160 --> 22:41.240
The Xue Lin case you just mentioned.

458
22:41.960 --> 22:44.680
It can be considered

459
22:44.880 --> 22:46.410
a major regret in my career.

460
22:46.840 --> 22:49.440
Back then, I hadn't started my own practice yet

461
22:49.680 --> 22:53.200
and was still a cog in my mentor's law firm.

462
22:53.680 --> 22:56.240
I handled trivial cases every day,

463
22:56.560 --> 22:59.640
always thinking about taking on a big one.

464
23:00.200 --> 23:01.240
It was at that time

465
23:01.640 --> 23:03.500
that I came across Xue Lin's case.

466
23:04.160 --> 23:06.560
She said she worked at Wangang.

467
23:07.280 --> 23:09.340
The production materials at Wangang

468
23:09.560 --> 23:10.960
were severely polluted,

469
23:10.960 --> 23:13.420
causing her to have frequent miscarriages.

470
23:13.720 --> 23:16.200
I took the case because I felt sorry for her.

471
23:17.120 --> 23:18.980
It was on a contingency fee basis.

472
23:19.720 --> 23:20.880
Contingency fee?

473
23:21.120 --> 23:22.180
When you're young,

474
23:22.600 --> 23:24.930
who isn't a bit passionate and impulsive?

475
23:25.120 --> 23:25.880
But Master,

476
23:26.040 --> 23:27.840
if Wangang was really polluted,

477
23:28.640 --> 23:31.440
Xue Lin shouldn't be the only one getting sick.

478
23:31.680 --> 23:33.280
That's the key to the matter.

479
23:33.520 --> 23:35.200
I went to Wangang to investigate.

480
23:35.200 --> 23:38.760
Except for her, the other employees were all healthy,

481
23:39.000 --> 23:40.530
with no signs of poisoning.

482
23:40.760 --> 23:42.920
The entire production process of Wangang

483
23:42.920 --> 23:44.850
also went through strict testing,

484
23:45.200 --> 23:46.480
and there were no problems at all.

485
23:46.480 --> 23:49.320
Then what caused her frequent miscarriages?

486
23:50.400 --> 23:53.060
I asked the doctor, and the reason is hard to say.

487
23:53.480 --> 23:56.240
It could be her own genetic issues,

488
23:56.440 --> 23:59.400
or some lifestyle habits,

489
23:59.520 --> 24:00.720
or even her emotions,

490
24:00.760 --> 24:03.160
all of which could cause her miscarriages.

491
24:03.240 --> 24:03.720
As for this case,

492
24:03.720 --> 24:05.640
later due to insufficient evidence,

493
24:05.640 --> 24:06.280
we lost.

494
24:06.400 --> 24:08.560
Xue Lin couldn't accept this reality.

495
24:08.960 --> 24:10.160
She made a scene many times

496
24:10.160 --> 24:11.920
and even said she would petition.

497
24:11.920 --> 24:13.850
Later, she had some mental issues,

498
24:13.920 --> 24:16.280
and her husband divorced her.

499
24:16.800 --> 24:19.480
Those remittance slips you saw that I sent her

500
24:20.040 --> 24:21.880
were all I could do.

501
24:22.520 --> 24:24.760
Even now, I often think,

502
24:25.600 --> 24:27.000
to fight a lawsuit,

503
24:27.280 --> 24:28.740
draining all your savings

504
24:28.840 --> 24:30.280
and your spirit,

505
24:30.920 --> 24:33.760
what's the use even if you win?

506
24:33.920 --> 24:36.250
If you can persuade the client to let it go,

507
24:36.280 --> 24:40.080
it might be more practical than winning a lawsuit.

508
24:41.640 --> 24:44.600
As a lawyer, you must make

509
24:44.920 --> 24:47.360
the most suitable choice for your client.

510
24:54.200 --> 24:55.920
I understand, Master.

511
24:56.720 --> 24:59.200
I've taken your words to heart.

512
25:00.640 --> 25:02.640
Come on, Brother Jun, a toast to you.

513
25:07.120 --> 25:08.920
Why did you bring such good wine?

514
25:10.120 --> 25:11.200
What's your intention?

515
25:11.200 --> 25:13.840
Look at you. Can't you think better of me?

516
25:14.040 --> 25:16.970
I'm genuinely doing this for Xiao Longnv's own good.

517
25:17.120 --> 25:17.920
Let me tell you

518
25:19.120 --> 25:20.560
about the Wangang case.

519
25:20.560 --> 25:22.280
I asked an insider

520
25:22.280 --> 25:23.280
to look into it.

521
25:23.360 --> 25:25.040
They said Wangang is fine.

522
25:25.120 --> 25:27.120
If you keep fighting like this, it's all for nothing.

523
25:27.120 --> 25:28.360
You won't win the case,

524
25:28.360 --> 25:30.480
and you'll just get yourself worked up.

525
25:30.480 --> 25:32.680
Anyway, the income from that law firm is unstable.

526
25:32.680 --> 25:33.640
Just persuade her

527
25:33.640 --> 25:34.920
to think about herself.

528
25:34.920 --> 25:35.980
What are you doing?

529
25:36.280 --> 25:38.140
Why do you care so much about this?

530
25:39.320 --> 25:41.880
I... I care about the firm's prospects and development.

531
25:41.880 --> 25:43.040
Shouldn't I?

532
25:44.440 --> 25:45.640
I can't persuade her.

533
25:45.960 --> 25:48.490
Besides, I think Xiaolong did nothing wrong.

534
25:48.560 --> 25:49.320
As for Wangang,

535
25:49.320 --> 25:51.320
even if he really did it, would he admit it?

536
25:51.320 --> 25:52.560
Even if he didn't do it,

537
25:52.560 --> 25:53.360
the worst that could happen

538
25:53.360 --> 25:54.840
is that Xiaolong loses the lawsuit.

539
25:54.840 --> 25:56.160
Yes, yes, she loses.

540
25:56.160 --> 25:59.360
If she loses, she'll get angry and upset,

541
25:59.360 --> 26:00.720
and then she'll...

542
26:01.120 --> 26:02.560
What are you trying to say?

543
26:02.560 --> 26:03.280
Let's just drink.

544
26:03.280 --> 26:04.440
You're incoherent. What's wrong with you?

545
26:04.440 --> 26:05.320
Let's drink.

546
26:05.320 --> 26:06.680
Come on, a toast to you,

547
26:06.680 --> 26:07.800
to you, father and daughter,

548
26:07.800 --> 26:09.400
and to your stubborn spirit.

549
26:11.120 --> 26:12.920
Why are you two so stubborn?

550
26:12.920 --> 26:13.840
I just don't get it.

551
26:13.840 --> 26:14.760
Hello, Mr. Wan.

552
26:14.760 --> 26:15.640
What kind of family are you from?

553
26:15.640 --> 26:17.600
Mr. Dong, are you busy?

554
26:18.360 --> 26:20.280
Dali, come. Let me introduce you.

555
26:20.440 --> 26:22.120
This is my childhood friend, Sun Zhuoli.

556
26:22.120 --> 26:23.200
This is our Leyang's

557
26:23.200 --> 26:25.160
famous head of the Eight Great Guardians.

558
26:25.160 --> 26:25.720
Xiao Jun.

559
26:26.360 --> 26:29.520
You've met. He delivered the shrimp that day.

560
26:31.120 --> 26:32.280
What do you mean?

561
26:36.920 --> 26:37.880
Nothing.

562
26:39.640 --> 26:40.200
Boss.

563
26:40.320 --> 26:41.520
Should we make a move?

564
26:41.640 --> 26:42.320
No need.

565
26:44.360 --> 26:45.280
Southern brothers.

566
26:45.280 --> 26:46.720
Hello, everyone.

567
26:46.720 --> 26:48.880
I'll arrange a welcome dinner for you all later,

568
26:48.880 --> 26:49.520
okay?

569
26:49.640 --> 26:50.920
It's fine.

570
26:51.120 --> 26:52.720
Brother Hu, the car you called is here.

571
26:52.720 --> 26:53.380
Here we are.

572
26:53.440 --> 26:55.320
I'll see Jun to his car first.

573
26:55.560 --> 26:56.640
We'll talk later.

574
27:01.800 --> 27:03.130
He owns this bathhouse.

575
27:04.200 --> 27:05.840
I wouldn't have come if I knew.

576
27:05.840 --> 27:07.640
When did you two become enemies?

577
27:07.880 --> 27:09.440
You're not young anymore.

578
27:12.560 --> 27:14.320
Mercury is a highly toxic metal.

579
27:14.320 --> 27:16.440
Mercury poisoning can cause many diseases.

580
27:16.440 --> 27:18.680
Besides the nervous and reproductive systems,

581
27:18.680 --> 27:20.160
as well as the digestive system,

582
27:20.160 --> 27:22.680
it can lead to liver and kidney diseases in severe cases,

583
27:22.680 --> 27:23.610
and even cancer.

584
27:24.400 --> 27:26.520
Our village is a bit weird.

585
27:26.680 --> 27:27.800
Look at the guy today.

586
27:27.800 --> 27:30.040
He passed away in his early forties.

587
27:30.040 --> 27:31.600
In his early forties?

588
27:32.080 --> 27:33.210
What disease was it?

589
27:33.480 --> 27:34.160
Cancer.

590
27:34.600 --> 27:37.240
By the time it was discovered, it was already in the late stage.

591
27:37.240 --> 27:38.640
Before that, his wife

592
27:38.720 --> 27:40.250
often said he was coughing,

593
27:40.320 --> 27:41.880
but no one paid attention.

594
27:42.760 --> 27:44.960
People in our village who live to our age

595
27:45.160 --> 27:46.440
are very few.

596
27:47.280 --> 27:48.280
The element mercury,

597
27:48.280 --> 27:49.340
in our daily lives,

598
27:49.360 --> 27:50.920
is not very easy to come into contact with.

599
27:50.920 --> 27:52.200
Except for mercury thermometers,

600
27:52.200 --> 27:53.200
in our daily lives,

601
27:53.200 --> 27:55.040
there are almost no items containing mercury.

602
27:55.040 --> 27:57.480
Mercury stays in the environment for an extremely long time.

603
27:57.480 --> 27:58.520
Once it causes pollution,

604
27:58.520 --> 28:00.920
especially in soil and groundwater,

605
28:00.960 --> 28:04.090
it will remain for a long time and continue to circulate.

606
28:05.400 --> 28:06.320
Miaomiao, Luo Zhi.

607
28:06.320 --> 28:08.040
You two look up some information for me.

608
28:08.040 --> 28:08.720
Okay.

609
28:12.360 --> 28:14.720
Director, I checked the health records of Fuyuan Village

610
28:14.720 --> 28:16.080
from 1995

611
28:16.200 --> 28:18.040
to 2010.

612
28:18.040 --> 28:20.040
There are 96 households in the village,

613
28:20.040 --> 28:22.720
and 19 of them have more or less

614
28:22.720 --> 28:25.200
shown diseases related to mercury poisoning.

615
28:25.200 --> 28:26.560
From 2001 onwards,

616
28:26.560 --> 28:28.920
the number of patients increased year by year.

617
28:28.920 --> 28:30.320
It reached its peak in 2005.

618
28:30.320 --> 28:31.320
It reached its peak in 2005.

619
28:31.320 --> 28:32.240
Then this

620
28:32.560 --> 28:34.240
matches the time when Xue Lin had frequent miscarriages.

621
28:34.240 --> 28:35.160
Right?

622
28:36.040 --> 28:38.680
This means that Fuyuan Village

623
28:38.920 --> 28:41.250
is very likely to have mercury pollution.

624
28:42.040 --> 28:45.160
So Xue Lin wasn't poisoned in Wangang,

625
28:45.320 --> 28:46.450
but in her hometown.

626
28:47.480 --> 28:48.800
After 2005,

627
28:48.800 --> 28:51.480
the morbidity rate of the villagers didn't increase anymore.

628
28:51.480 --> 28:53.640
Could it be that after 2005,

629
28:53.920 --> 28:55.440
the mercury pollution in Fuyuan Village

630
28:55.440 --> 28:56.560
completely disappeared?

631
28:56.560 --> 28:58.420
It definitely didn't disappear.

632
28:58.560 --> 29:01.600
It was deliberately covered up.

633
29:04.040 --> 29:05.920
Come, take a look at this report.

634
29:06.920 --> 29:10.640
Fuyuan Village Officially Connected to Municipal Tap Water.

635
29:11.120 --> 29:12.640
June 2005.

636
29:13.120 --> 29:16.720
Yes. Then guess which company

637
29:16.720 --> 29:18.800
funded this project?

638
29:19.080 --> 29:19.840
Wangang.

639
29:20.360 --> 29:20.880
Yes.

640
29:21.040 --> 29:22.160
This is the cooperation agreement

641
29:22.160 --> 29:23.490
I found in the archives.

642
29:26.240 --> 29:29.240
Fuyuan Village Villagers' Committee, Baizhao County.

643
29:29.240 --> 29:30.840
Isn't this a bit too coincidental?

644
29:30.840 --> 29:33.300
There are no such coincidences in the world.

645
29:33.560 --> 29:37.120
There are plenty of seemingly random but well-thought-out plans.

646
29:37.120 --> 29:39.560
Mr. Li, what should we do next?

647
29:41.120 --> 29:44.280
Keep your mouths shut until the investigation is complete.

648
29:44.280 --> 29:45.080
Understood.

649
29:49.080 --> 29:51.400
What does Li Xin investigating Fuyuan Village

650
29:51.400 --> 29:52.760
have to do with Wangang?

651
29:53.560 --> 29:55.160
Of course it does.

652
29:55.760 --> 29:56.440
Back in 2005,

653
29:56.440 --> 29:57.170
Back in 2005,

654
29:57.280 --> 30:00.480
Wangang funded the tap water project for Fuyuan Village.

655
30:01.160 --> 30:02.960
At this critical moment,

656
30:03.000 --> 30:05.280
investigating this ancient history,

657
30:05.520 --> 30:07.450
don't you find it a bit suspicious?

658
30:09.440 --> 30:10.300
How do you know?

659
30:13.680 --> 30:15.440
How I know is not important.

660
30:16.760 --> 30:19.440
What's important is that Lawyer Li can find out.

661
30:20.000 --> 30:23.520
Xiao Longnv might also be digging into this clue.

662
30:23.920 --> 30:26.040
This also reminds me of something.

663
30:26.800 --> 30:29.560
Before Director Wang founded Honghu,

664
30:29.760 --> 30:31.560
he and I were at another law firm.

665
30:32.040 --> 30:34.480
At that time, he took a case

666
30:35.160 --> 30:38.720
helping a Wangang employee sue Wangang.

667
30:39.600 --> 30:43.240
This Xue Lin happens to be from Fuyuan Village.

668
30:43.840 --> 30:46.480
With all these things connected,

669
30:47.240 --> 30:48.000
Mr. Wan,

670
30:49.080 --> 30:50.840
what do you think this means?

671
30:54.840 --> 30:55.720
Which means

672
30:56.760 --> 30:59.840
it might be an opportunity for us.

673
31:02.480 --> 31:03.080
Here, Dad.

674
31:04.000 --> 31:06.160
I noticed you haven't had much of an appetite lately,

675
31:06.160 --> 31:09.220
so I had someone buy some good wild ginseng from abroad.

676
31:10.600 --> 31:12.840
Li, that's very thoughtful of you.

677
31:13.000 --> 31:14.400
It's the least I could do.

678
31:15.200 --> 31:15.840
Try some.

679
31:16.000 --> 31:16.520
Okay.

680
31:16.760 --> 31:17.960
Some people

681
31:17.960 --> 31:20.440
are choosing this exact moment,

682
31:20.440 --> 31:22.200
when we're cooperating with Nanfu,

683
31:22.200 --> 31:23.120
to sow discord.

684
31:23.240 --> 31:24.480
It makes me so mad.

685
31:25.320 --> 31:26.520
Some people?

686
31:27.480 --> 31:28.680
Who exactly?

687
31:29.280 --> 31:31.680
That troublemaker Xiao Longnv, of course.

688
31:32.600 --> 31:33.440
I heard

689
31:34.240 --> 31:36.680
our family used to have a...

690
31:37.520 --> 31:39.650
with that Fu... Fu something village.

691
31:40.720 --> 31:43.720
Do we have some secret with that village?

692
31:44.960 --> 31:47.320
Our family and that whatever village...

693
31:47.400 --> 31:49.120
What secret could we possibly have?

694
31:49.120 --> 31:50.780
How come I don't know about it?

695
31:55.560 --> 31:56.880
You really don't know.

696
32:00.760 --> 32:01.240
Dad.

697
32:02.440 --> 32:05.040
When I was a kid, I wanted to be a police officer.

698
32:05.440 --> 32:06.770
I wanted to solve cases.

699
32:07.680 --> 32:09.680
I'm really good at solving cases.

700
32:10.600 --> 32:13.730
I heard someone has already traced it to Fuyuan Village.

701
32:14.400 --> 32:16.060
You didn't know that, did you?

702
32:16.680 --> 32:20.760
Dad, you have so much on your plate every day.

703
32:21.800 --> 32:24.840
Don't trouble yourself with such a small matter.

704
32:24.840 --> 32:25.800
Leave it to me.

705
32:26.080 --> 32:27.610
I can definitely handle it.

706
32:28.560 --> 32:30.890
So you know how to care for your old man now.

707
32:31.360 --> 32:32.880
I also had someone get a leopard coral grouper.

708
32:32.880 --> 32:34.400
It's being cooked in the kitchen.

709
32:34.400 --> 32:35.960
It's really good for your health.

710
32:35.960 --> 32:38.360
I need to keep an eye on it and watch the heat.

711
32:38.600 --> 32:39.640
You go ahead and eat.

712
32:39.640 --> 32:39.920
Alright, alright.

713
32:39.920 --> 32:41.080
Please, go ahead and eat.

714
32:41.080 --> 32:41.720
Okay.

715
33:01.720 --> 33:02.360
Xiaolong.

716
33:05.520 --> 33:07.120
I've disinfected it for you.

717
33:07.480 --> 33:08.160
Thank you.

718
33:09.000 --> 33:10.860
Why did you ask me out so suddenly?

719
33:12.480 --> 33:14.140
You might have noticed it too.

720
33:15.080 --> 33:17.120
Old Pan's case is not that simple.

721
33:18.240 --> 33:19.360
What did you find?

722
33:22.280 --> 33:23.680
It's not just Xue Lin.

723
33:24.360 --> 33:28.160
Many people in their village are suffering from mercury poisoning.

724
33:28.240 --> 33:29.920
Wangang, 28 years ago,

725
33:29.920 --> 33:31.040
or even earlier,

726
33:31.040 --> 33:32.900
already had pollution problems.

727
33:33.240 --> 33:36.100
It killed not only fish and shrimp, but also people.

728
33:36.840 --> 33:38.280
Do you have any evidence?

729
33:39.160 --> 33:41.020
Existence always leaves a trace.

730
33:41.560 --> 33:43.620
I will definitely find the evidence.

731
33:52.280 --> 33:53.000
Li Xin.

732
33:55.960 --> 33:56.600
I know.

733
33:57.560 --> 33:59.320
You are Wangang's attorney.

734
34:00.040 --> 34:02.770
You have a responsibility to defend your client.

735
34:03.760 --> 34:06.200
But can you also ask yourself,

736
34:06.760 --> 34:08.239
is such a company

737
34:08.239 --> 34:10.120
worth defending like this?

738
34:14.719 --> 34:15.600
Xiaolong, do you know

739
34:15.600 --> 34:17.730
if something goes wrong with Wangang,

740
34:18.159 --> 34:20.290
how serious the consequences will be?

741
34:20.440 --> 34:22.639
Wangang is a pillar industry in Leyang.

742
34:22.880 --> 34:23.920
If something goes wrong,

743
34:23.920 --> 34:25.239
tens of thousands of people will face unemployment,

744
34:25.239 --> 34:27.679
and tens of thousands of families will be affected.

745
34:27.679 --> 34:28.480
By then,

746
34:28.760 --> 34:30.760
Leyang's economy and people's livelihood

747
34:30.760 --> 34:32.080
will be shaken.

748
34:32.080 --> 34:33.760
Just like the foreign company Essex

749
34:33.760 --> 34:35.360
and the former Ruifeng Energy.

750
34:35.360 --> 34:36.760
These are all lessons from the past.

751
34:36.760 --> 34:37.480
Yes.

752
34:38.080 --> 34:39.639
But we can't just calculate the economic cost

753
34:39.639 --> 34:41.560
and ignore the cost of human lives.

754
34:41.560 --> 34:44.800
We all know that the right to life is above everything else.

755
34:44.800 --> 34:47.719
If Wangang falls, the economy might suffer short-term pain.

756
34:47.719 --> 34:49.920
But if it continues to pollute like this,

757
34:49.920 --> 34:52.920
what's the point of the economy if the people are gone?

758
34:55.560 --> 34:57.960
I know I'm crossing the line by saying this.

759
34:58.920 --> 35:00.050
You used to advise me

760
35:01.080 --> 35:02.760
not to take Old Pan's case.

761
35:04.000 --> 35:05.930
Now I sincerely want to advise you.

762
35:08.400 --> 35:10.400
Can you stop representing Wangang?

763
35:12.280 --> 35:13.120
Even if I don't represent them,

764
35:13.120 --> 35:14.280
someone else will.

765
35:14.280 --> 35:16.340
But I don't want that person to be you.

766
35:26.880 --> 35:28.040
This is the 1997

767
35:28.040 --> 35:29.840
production ledger for Wangang.

768
35:30.040 --> 35:30.920
In the third quarter,

769
35:30.920 --> 35:32.600
the company received a large order.

770
35:32.600 --> 35:33.800
Compared to the second quarter,

771
35:33.800 --> 35:35.560
production increased by 41,000 tons.

772
35:35.560 --> 35:36.920
The budget for waste disposal

773
35:36.920 --> 35:38.800
correspondingly increased by 1.05 million.

774
35:38.800 --> 35:39.920
I calculated the expenses.

775
35:39.920 --> 35:41.080
All the invoices add up

776
35:41.080 --> 35:42.480
to exactly 1.05 million.

777
35:42.480 --> 35:44.080
But look at these invoices.

778
35:44.400 --> 35:45.560
The handwriting is different.

779
35:45.560 --> 35:46.800
They were obviously added later.

780
35:46.800 --> 35:47.920
So I went to find

781
35:47.920 --> 35:49.160
the now-retired

782
35:49.200 --> 35:51.040
former legal director of Wangang, Wu Jiang.

783
35:51.040 --> 35:53.360
After my emotional, rational,

784
35:53.360 --> 35:54.240
persistent,

785
35:54.240 --> 35:55.200
and very hard

786
35:55.200 --> 35:55.640
lobbying...

787
35:55.640 --> 35:56.570
Get to the point.

788
35:56.800 --> 35:59.920
He hinted to me

789
36:00.160 --> 36:02.360
that Mr. Wan said he would use this money

790
36:02.400 --> 36:04.260
to fill a hole in another project,

791
36:04.560 --> 36:05.760
and transferred it away.

792
36:05.760 --> 36:07.240
He said once the project's payment was received,

793
36:07.240 --> 36:08.520
he would put the money back.

794
36:08.520 --> 36:09.400
Did he put it back?

795
36:09.400 --> 36:10.800
Of course not.

796
36:10.800 --> 36:12.920
And I also found out

797
36:13.160 --> 36:14.360
that back in 1997,

798
36:14.360 --> 36:17.080
Mr. Wan bought his parents and his father-in-law

799
36:17.080 --> 36:18.560
a villa each.

800
36:19.280 --> 36:22.140
Are you saying Mr. Wan misappropriated this money?

801
36:22.760 --> 36:23.760
There's no proof.

802
36:24.280 --> 36:25.240
And...

803
36:25.880 --> 36:27.520
Are we digging too deep?

804
36:28.040 --> 36:31.040
Some things are harder to deal with once you know them.

805
36:54.400 --> 36:55.120
Xiaolong.

806
36:56.280 --> 36:56.720
Oh my god.

807
36:56.720 --> 36:57.520
Why are you here?

808
36:57.520 --> 36:58.680
I called you earlier,

809
36:58.680 --> 36:59.760
and you said you were coming right back.

810
36:59.760 --> 37:01.600
But when I saw you hadn't returned for two or three hours,

811
37:01.600 --> 37:02.280
I got worried.

812
37:02.280 --> 37:04.520
I almost went to the law firm to look for you.

813
37:04.520 --> 37:06.240
I was just reading the files late

814
37:06.240 --> 37:07.120
and lost track of time.

815
37:07.120 --> 37:08.840
Next time you work late,

816
37:08.840 --> 37:09.760
tell me,

817
37:09.760 --> 37:10.890
and I'll pick you up.

818
37:11.040 --> 37:13.080
I'm an adult. Why do you still need to pick me up?

819
37:13.080 --> 37:13.520
No,

820
37:13.520 --> 37:14.520
no matter how old you are,

821
37:14.520 --> 37:16.080
you're still my child.

822
37:16.080 --> 37:18.810
I have a responsibility to protect you, you know?

823
37:29.840 --> 37:30.680
Miao.

824
37:31.200 --> 37:32.720
How is it? Is everyone okay?

825
37:32.720 --> 37:34.360
I'm fine. I just got to the law firm,

826
37:34.360 --> 37:35.600
and found it smashed.

827
37:35.960 --> 37:39.560
Luo Zhi has gone to the police to check the surveillance footage.

828
37:58.080 --> 37:59.140
Miao, you're back.

829
37:59.200 --> 37:59.800
Sister Long.

830
37:59.800 --> 38:00.440
How is it?

831
38:00.440 --> 38:01.640
Did you see who it was?

832
38:02.200 --> 38:04.330
All three were wearing masks and hats.

833
38:04.400 --> 38:05.520
We couldn't see their faces.

834
38:05.520 --> 38:08.520
But the restaurant diagonally opposite closes late.

835
38:08.640 --> 38:11.040
The boss vaguely heard them say,

836
38:13.880 --> 38:16.400
Hurry up, idiot.

837
38:16.880 --> 38:18.480
That's what it sounded like.

838
38:21.200 --> 38:22.040
Welcome.

839
38:24.440 --> 38:25.880
Regarding energy saving and emission reduction.

840
38:25.880 --> 38:27.140
It has to be Dong Beihu.

841
38:28.080 --> 38:29.440
Why are you here? To take a bath?

842
38:29.440 --> 38:30.280
Where is Wan Zhuoli?

843
38:30.280 --> 38:30.960
In the office.

844
38:30.960 --> 38:31.960
Take me to see him.

845
38:32.480 --> 38:32.960
What's wrong?

846
38:32.960 --> 38:34.820
Never mind what it is. Where is he?

847
38:35.040 --> 38:35.880
Inside. You...

848
38:35.880 --> 38:36.760
That way, right?

849
38:36.760 --> 38:38.440
Why are you... Slow down a bit.

850
38:42.600 --> 38:44.480
Hole in one. You're amazing, boss.

851
38:44.480 --> 38:46.720
Wan Zhuoli! Wan Zhuoli!

852
38:50.120 --> 38:51.160
I'm warning you.

853
38:51.400 --> 38:53.240
Stop playing these dirty tricks on me.

854
38:53.240 --> 38:53.960
This is a society ruled by law.

855
38:53.960 --> 38:56.020
It won't tolerate your lawlessness.

856
38:58.600 --> 39:00.800
Why are you always so angry?

857
39:01.120 --> 39:03.000
You act like you ate gunpowder every time you see me.

858
39:03.000 --> 39:04.400
What did I do to you?

859
39:04.600 --> 39:05.720
If you can't win the lawsuit,

860
39:05.720 --> 39:07.250
don't sling mud at me, okay?

861
39:07.280 --> 39:08.760
Stop playing dumb with me.

862
39:08.840 --> 39:10.480
Don't you know what you did?

863
39:10.960 --> 39:11.720
I'm telling you.

864
39:11.720 --> 39:13.920
I will investigate this case to the end.

865
39:14.640 --> 39:16.120
Investigate all you want.

866
39:16.120 --> 39:17.920
Investigate thoroughly to the very end.

867
39:17.920 --> 39:18.960
Give it your all.

868
39:20.000 --> 39:21.320
As if I'm afraid of you.

869
39:22.520 --> 39:24.120
Dali, tell me the truth.

870
39:24.120 --> 39:25.160
What exactly did you do?

871
39:25.160 --> 39:26.120
What did I do?

872
39:26.400 --> 39:27.720
Are you doubting me too?

873
39:27.720 --> 39:29.800
No, whose side are you on?

874
39:30.240 --> 39:32.160
It's not about whose side I'm on right now.

875
39:32.160 --> 39:32.560
Let me tell you.

876
39:32.560 --> 39:34.680
I grew up with you, so I know you.

877
39:35.040 --> 39:37.400
But you've changed since you came back, you know?

878
39:37.400 --> 39:39.320
If there's an issue, we can just go to court.

879
39:39.320 --> 39:40.640
You can't resort to crooked means.

880
39:40.640 --> 39:41.440
Do you hear me?

881
39:43.400 --> 39:44.530
Got it. Don't worry.

882
39:44.880 --> 39:46.080
I know what I'm doing.

883
39:54.040 --> 39:54.770
Lawyer Xiao,

884
39:54.920 --> 39:57.650
Did your window get broken into by a thief or what?

885
39:59.320 --> 40:00.180
It was the wind.

886
40:00.760 --> 40:03.120
I'll get someone to fix it in a couple of days.

887
40:03.120 --> 40:04.320
Let's talk business.

888
40:05.960 --> 40:07.960
I've consulted a hydrology expert.

889
40:08.240 --> 40:10.560
The expert said the groundwater in Fuyuan Village

890
40:10.560 --> 40:12.080
backflowed due to the rainstorm,

891
40:12.080 --> 40:14.440
flowing from the Baizhao River to the farm.

892
40:14.440 --> 40:15.600
Right, right, right.

893
40:15.600 --> 40:17.560
Before the shrimp died in batches this time,

894
40:17.560 --> 40:20.240
there was a very, very heavy rainstorm.

895
40:21.680 --> 40:24.610
But we have this kind of rainstorm almost every year.

896
40:24.760 --> 40:27.220
Our farm only had issues starting last year.

897
40:27.280 --> 40:30.360
Lawyer Xiao, nothing happened before.

898
40:30.360 --> 40:32.400
For flood control last year,

899
40:32.840 --> 40:34.320
didn't they dig a new river channel?

900
40:34.320 --> 40:35.800
This connected the Baizhao River

901
40:35.800 --> 40:37.840
and the water of the farm.

902
40:37.840 --> 40:39.720
That's why the rainstorm caused a backflow,

903
40:39.720 --> 40:42.240
and the water flowed from the Baizhao River to the farm.

904
40:42.240 --> 40:44.240
No wonder. That makes sense.

905
40:44.360 --> 40:45.160
Next,

906
40:46.000 --> 40:48.040
I plan to find a professional institution

907
40:48.040 --> 40:50.440
to test the groundwater in Fuyuan Village.

908
40:50.800 --> 40:53.160
As long as we can determine the source of the mercury,

909
40:53.160 --> 40:55.080
it will not only help your case,

910
40:55.080 --> 40:57.340
but also help the entire Fuyuan Village.

911
40:59.600 --> 41:01.440
The due diligence agency hired by Nanfu Group

912
41:01.440 --> 41:02.600
is very formidable.

913
41:02.760 --> 41:05.880
They claim to be the microscope team in the industry.

914
41:06.240 --> 41:08.960
They have already investigated the farmers' lawsuit,

915
41:08.960 --> 41:11.600
including the leak last year.

916
41:11.800 --> 41:13.440
We won the first trial.

917
41:13.520 --> 41:14.640
What are you afraid of?

918
41:14.640 --> 41:16.280
What their team is best at

919
41:16.280 --> 41:18.400
is turning subtle potential risks

920
41:18.520 --> 41:21.160
into huge bargaining chips.

921
41:21.560 --> 41:22.920
Last year, there was a

922
41:22.920 --> 41:24.640
new energy company preparing to go public.

923
41:24.640 --> 41:28.300
Because their unresolved environmental issues were uncovered,

924
41:28.440 --> 41:31.080
their valuation was cut by 30% in the end.

925
41:31.440 --> 41:34.400
So, even if it's just baseless rumors,

926
41:34.520 --> 41:37.040
I hope we can solve it as soon as possible

927
41:37.360 --> 41:40.000
to minimize the impact on the M&A.

928
41:40.120 --> 41:41.920
I am the supervisor of the group.

929
41:42.120 --> 41:43.120
My duty

930
41:43.200 --> 41:46.600
is to supervise the legal and compliant operation of the group

931
41:46.600 --> 41:49.800
and protect the interests of shareholders and partners.

932
41:53.920 --> 41:54.560
Lawyer Li.

933
41:56.760 --> 41:58.420
What do you think we should do?

934
42:00.240 --> 42:03.320
I think what Mr. Sun said makes sense.

935
42:04.080 --> 42:05.000
Come on.

936
42:06.440 --> 42:07.840
That's not what we're asking.

937
42:07.840 --> 42:09.040
My dad is asking you

938
42:09.240 --> 42:11.680
what you plan to do about Fuyuan Village.

939
42:12.760 --> 42:14.880
Is there a problem with Fuyuan Village?

940
42:14.880 --> 42:16.440
Don't play dumb.

941
42:18.680 --> 42:19.880
I'm just a lawyer.

942
42:20.480 --> 42:22.810
A lawyer's duty isn't to know everything.

943
42:22.960 --> 42:25.890
The most important thing is knowing what not to know.

944
42:36.960 --> 42:39.320
Mr. Li, according to the test results,

945
42:39.320 --> 42:41.440
you have glioblastoma.

946
42:41.960 --> 42:43.420
It is a type of brain tumor,

947
42:43.560 --> 42:47.000
which is why you are experiencing symptoms like headaches and forgetfulness.

948
42:47.000 --> 42:49.040
It is best to schedule surgery as soon as possible.

949
42:49.040 --> 42:51.320
You should go back and discuss it with your family.
